OL,3,GNEWSAHospice plans move forward with
OL,4,A#3.53m boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new hospice and community
OL,7,Fcare hub in Kent have moved forward
OL,8,Fwith the approval of #3.53m of council
OL,9,Ffunding for the project.
OL,11,FMaidstone Borough Council said the
OL,12,Ffunds marked "a significant milestone"
OL,13,Ffor the #18.5m Heart of Kent Hospice
OL,14,Fproject in Linton.
OL,16,FThe purpose-built hospice will provide
OL,17,Fpalliative care facilities alongside
OL,18,Fwider health and care services for
OL,19,Fpeople across Maidstone and the
OL,20,Fsurrounding area.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
