OL,3,GNEWSAHospice plans move forward with
OL,4,A#3.53m boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said more than a third of
OL,7,Fthe project cost had now been secured.
OL,8,FHowever, the hospice still needs to
OL,9,Fraise a further #12m and there is no
OL,10,Fconstruction start date until the
OL,11,Fremaining funds are found.
